# Server (Python / FastAPI)

## Layout (target per P0 plan)

```text
server/src/
  main.py           # FastAPI app, routes
  models.py         # Domain models — extend here first
  services/         # parser, jd, gap, changes, export, llm_client
  storage/          # Session file I/O
```

## Conventions

- Python 3.11+; Pydantic v2 for all API schemas.
- Ruff per `docs/contributing.md`; run `pytest` for touched logic.
- LLM access only through `llm_client` (or `services/llm_client.py`) — no scattered `openai` calls.
- File upload: validate MIME/size; store under session id; no permanent storage without TTL design.
- Export: apply **only** user-accepted `Change` ids; DOCX via python-docx.

## Testing expectations

Add tests when changing:

- Resume/JD parsers
- Policy guard evaluation
- Change generation merge / export
- Session API contracts

## Dependencies

- LiteLLM + env vars (`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`, etc.) — never commit keys.
- Optional: `python-docx`, `httpx`, `pydantic-settings`

Do not add heavy frameworks (Celery, SQLAlchemy) unless P0 plan is updated and user agrees.
